{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16305030","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16305030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1630503001:0":{"text":"ホープ先生がついに変身魔法を教えてくれるんだって！","source_cn":"赫普老师终于要教我们变形术了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EDEDBE68AA34690","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1630503002:0":{"text":"ああ。自分が動物に変身できると考えたら、興奮して一晩中眠れなかったよ！","source_cn":"是啊，一想到自己可以变成别的小动物，我就激动得一宿睡不着觉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAD750980E8D1AEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1630503003:0":{"text":"考えてみて、鳥になって空も飛べちゃうんだよ！","source_cn":"想想看，我的身子可以变成鸟飞到空中！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CB18B6A4002F98C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1630503004:0":{"text":"でも、鳥への変身は上級クラスからじゃなかったかな……","source_cn":"变鸟可是高级课程，我们应该学不到那里吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63210D803B0E01B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1630503005:0":{"text":"だとしても、リスには変身できるよね！あの一番高い木に登れるだけでも最高だよ！","source_cn":"那，能变个松鼠也是极好的啊！我要爬上这里最高的那棵树！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB47C20BEA3A89D2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_